{
    "name": "[Baseline] - WIN - D - Shared Devices OneDrive",
    "description": "Signs OneDrive on shared devices in silently with the work account, puts Desktop, Documents and Pictures in OneDrive and keeps files online-only, including those of synced team sites, so that nothing stays behind in a profile that Shared PC cleans up and the disk does not fill up with a copy per user. Baseline assignment: none by default — belongs on SG-D-UEM-WIN-Shared. Source: Own baseline — the same values as [Baseline] - WIN - D - Microsoft OneDrive for silent sign-in, Files On-Demand, Known Folder Move and the allowed tenant, plus Convert synced team site files to online-only files (DehydrateSyncedTeamSites, Microsoft Learn: Use OneDrive policies to control sync settings)..",
